{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":false,"title":"Search creators"},"description":"Search Instagram and TikTok creators with a natural-language brief. Returns up to 50 ranked creators with fit score, follower count, platform, the 3 best-matching videos, and a shortlistId for enrich_creators when available. Bios and captions are cut to 150 characters. The creator's website link is returned as written, or null when it is longer than 200 characters. Every other link is a short link that redirects for 24 hours. When the result would pass 140,000 characters, the lowest ranked creators are left out until it fits. The brief in q sets no filter; platform, country, and tier filter. Contact addresses stay empty until reveal_contact. Holds the call open until the result, up to 800 seconds.\n\nEach search is one use. Unsigned callers get 100 uses per rolling 24 hours per IP. Identified callers get 200 uses per rolling 24 hours, then prepaid credits. Pre-claim agent tokens skip the daily grant and use prepaid credits only.\n\nenrich_creators takes these creators, query.q, and shortlistId for niche, evidence, and signal analysis.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":true,"properties":{"country":{"description":"One or more ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 country codes in either letter case, comma separated, such as us or us,ca","pattern":"^(?:\\s*(?:[aA][dD]|[aA][eE]|[aA][fF]|[aA][gG]|[aA][iI]|[aA][lL]|[aA][mM]|[aA][oO]|[aA][qQ]|[aA][rR]|[aA][sS]|[aA][tT]|[aA][uU]|[aA][wW]|[aA][xX]|[aA][zZ]|[bB][aA]|[bB][bB]|[bB][dD]|[bB][eE]|[bB][fF]|[bB][gG]|[bB][hH]|[bB][iI]|[bB][jJ]|[bB][lL]|[bB][mM]|[bB][nN]|[bB][oO]|[bB][qQ]|[bB][rR]|[bB][sS]|[bB][tT]|[bB][vV]|[bB][wW]|[bB][yY]|[bB][zZ]|[cC][aA]|[cC][cC]|[cC][dD]|[cC][fF]|[cC][gG]|[cC][hH]|[cC][iI]|[cC][kK]|[cC][lL]|[cC][mM]|[cC][nN]|[cC][oO]|[cC][rR]|[cC][uU]|[cC][vV]|[cC][wW]|[cC][xX]|[cC][yY]|[cC][zZ]|[dD][eE]|[dD][jJ]|[dD][kK]|[dD][mM]|[dD][oO]|[dD][z